{"time": 1752997033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2089212936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "在你逃命的时候"}
{"time": 1752997105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "178050110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "伽薇的嘴巴缓缓的耷拉着打开，你一点也不熟悉的，如同通过了长长的甬道般掺夹着回音的声音从中发出。而这个声音正在不断重复念着的一个字，“我”"}
{"time": 1752997148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1557854844", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...啊？什么\""}
{"time": 1752997151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "856413083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "身后伽薇被那未知的生物一镰刀一镰刀的割开，血液四处飞溅"}
{"time": 1752997176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1905822982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（可以过个意志豁免，dc20）"}
{"time": 1752997199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "719426422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd20+4"}
{"time": 1752997199, "type": "reply", "message_id": "719426422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[桃乐丝]演奏出: 1D20+4={11}+4=15"}
{"time": 1752997208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "85516044", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1752997289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "267852323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那你疲于奔命，一直不停的跑着，不知道跑了多久多久，雾仍然笼罩着你，脚步声也永不停息"}
{"time": 1752997391, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1384363054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...”感觉这么跑下去也无济于事，准备回头"}
{"time": 1752997402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1130468210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“来救我...”"}
{"time": 1752997420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "465535906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你发现自己的鼻子开始流血，随后血迹在地上形成了一个字"}
{"time": 1752997432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "764336331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“醒”"}
{"time": 1752997484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1206677715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...”"}
{"time": 1752997496, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1872687750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“原来，是一场梦吗？”"}
{"time": 1752997566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1338995689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "当你意识到原来这所有的一切都只是一场噩梦的时候，你周遭的一切开始扭曲，随后缓缓消散"}
{"time": 1752997605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1414805777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...我是？”"}
{"time": 1752997768, "type": "recv", "message_id": "744592550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "随后你逐渐清醒过来，发现自己好像在一个监牢里，你没有感觉到任何不适，除了好像流了一点鼻血，同时除了陌生的天花板以外，你还看到了红着眼眶的伽薇，坐在你的身旁"}
{"time": 1752997827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "923965869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...我这是”"}
{"time": 1752997862, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1780874858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“枷薇...你还活着吗？我也..”"}
{"time": 1752997876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1842842315", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看到你醒来，伽薇立马扑了过来抱住了你“太好了，奥契丝姐姐，刚刚只是一场梦，我们还活着...”"}
{"time": 1752997956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "23739343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“真的只是一场梦吗？”一只手抱着她，另一只手摸着她的后脑勺安抚"}
{"time": 1752997973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "194747469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“活着就好...”脑子有点痛，这里是哪里"}
{"time": 1752998026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1713360867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“快醒来！该死的家伙！”台上的男人怒吼着，他的恐慌的声音打破了幽邃的黑暗。监牢的闩将你们与那人隔开，一个嘴唇干裂的人正挣扎着，他的皮肤上满是鲜红的伤痕。粗实的麻绳将他捆在了工作台上。另一个体型瘦削，身着沾染着血迹的医生服的人则绕着桌子转，偶尔停下来查看一下那人的伤口或者从橱柜中选取新的道具。现在她手中转动着只有一边的修枝剪刀，在暗淡的灯光下闪烁着寒光。“医生”粗鲁而残忍的用剪刀在那被绑着的人裸露着的大腿上划动，让他发出痛苦的哀嚎。"}
{"time": 1752998110, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1249964492", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“呃..这是哪里”"}
{"time": 1752998150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "683613736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我..也不知道，好像是一个监狱”"}
{"time": 1752998161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1692906002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "捂着枷薇的眼睛不让她看着血腥的一幕"}
{"time": 1752998248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1731396442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没事，奥契丝姐姐，虽然什么都不记得了，但伽薇有种感觉，只要奥契丝姐姐在我身旁，伽薇就什么都不怕”"}
{"time": 1752998352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1890267176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...我也不清楚，奥契丝在寻找什么..但是我现在忘了，所以...有些迷茫。”捂着脑袋，“不过至少，现在要从这里离开。”"}
{"time": 1752998367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037944288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看看牢房有没有办法出去"}
{"time": 1752998434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2127349360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "坚实的铁框栏栅让你们只能从缝隙中看向外面，而且门被一把沉重的锁锁住"}
{"time": 1752998443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "413049190", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（dc20的解除装置）"}
{"time": 1752998454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "502573599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（dc25的解除装置）"}
{"time": 1752998496, "type": "recv", "message_id": "790823962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd20+4"}
{"time": 1752998496, "type": "reply", "message_id": "790823962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[桃乐丝]演奏出: 1D20+4={13}+4=17"}
{"time": 1752998524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1621294835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你想尝试开锁，但这个锁过于复杂，但你眼尖的发现，那个医生的腰上有一串钥匙"}
{"time": 1752998574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "207483691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "法师之手"}
{"time": 1752998652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "460068808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不过你开锁的动静似乎惊动了医生，医生回头看向你“安静一点哟，下一个就到你啦。”随后医生扭头继续思考下一刀砍在哪里"}
{"time": 1752998719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1335297684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd+3"}
{"time": 1752998719, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1335297684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[桃乐丝]演奏出: 1D20+3={4}+3=7"}
{"time": 1752998794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "351850258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "伽薇尝试用法师之手去偷取钥匙，她小声的告诉你“别担心，奥契丝姐姐，我们马上就能出去了”"}
{"time": 1752998862, "type": "recv", "message_id": "67297226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“小心一些...被发现就出事了。”"}
{"time": 1752998918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1314311756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "但不幸的是，她的动作被医生察觉到了，医生生气的回头看着你们，她愤怒的扭过头来，而且面容变成了奥契丝的模样“给我安分一点！”"}
{"time": 1752998938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1430447611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“啊？”"}
{"time": 1752998998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2086309955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "伽薇看到医生的身体上出现了你的脸，有些害怕，蜷缩了起来..."}
{"time": 1752999085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "838135090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“别怕别怕。”抱着她安抚，“那是变形怪，我在这里。”"}
{"time": 1752999119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "375561335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯..谢谢奥契丝姐姐”听了一的话，她状态逐渐好转起来"}
{"time": 1752999127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1162993212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "四处看看，监牢里是不是只有医生一个"}
{"time": 1752999175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "104002945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“枷薇，待会我们把真红和亚里莎放出来..把坏人打倒”"}
{"time": 1752999244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "450670520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不过当医生看向你们的时候，那个患者尝试挣脱沾满鲜血的绳子，试图让自己的脚能自由活动，当医生继续回头准备解剖他的时候，那人一脚蹬住了医生的脸，医生被蹬倒在地，钥匙飞到了你们牢房的门前，医生非常的生气"}
{"time": 1752999247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "214431475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".r1d4"}
{"time": 1752999247, "type": "reply", "message_id": "214431475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[露儿]演奏出: 1D4=3"}
{"time": 1752999281, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1477147784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "随后他一改之前的慢慢凌迟，开始对那人进行彻底的解剖"}
{"time": 1752999301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1528962611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看样子短时间内，医生沉浸在了他的杀人游戏里"}
{"time": 1752999380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "499148078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "抓起钥匙，召唤幻灵"}
{"time": 1752999382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1550202371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那你们二人顺利召唤出了幻灵，医生并没有看见凭空出现了两个生物，继续沉浸在杀人中"}
{"time": 1752999473, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1846583952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "祝福术神恩魔化武器魔牙"}
{"time": 1752999485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1706654339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "防护邪恶法师护甲"}
{"time": 1752999487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "460305091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "开门"}
