{"time": 1752999896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1645933716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你们轻松便击杀了医生，随后伽薇拿起小刀，上去对着医生尸体的脸便是一顿乱搅“居然敢变成奥契丝姐姐的样子......“"}
{"time": 1752999921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "908810481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“呃...”"}
{"time": 1752999961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1106603365", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你在医生身上找到了你们身上本来的东西"}
{"time": 1753000017, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1403245461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(?)"}
{"time": 1753000043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1695042088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯..”看一看另外几个牢房"}
{"time": 1753000066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2094448208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd3"}
{"time": 1753000066, "type": "reply", "message_id": "2094448208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[桃乐丝]演奏出: 1D3=1"}
{"time": 1753000105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1349838449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "一个宽阔的斜槽斜着伸出这个地窖其中一面半碎的石墙。在其之下堆着十几个被肢解了的人类尸体。在旁边，有一排摇摇晃晃的木制台阶延伸向高高的天花板—这个出口似乎你们并不能用。房间里的腐臭味扑面而来，空中充斥着苍蝇的嗡嗡声。"}
{"time": 1753000129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "182714357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd+4"}
{"time": 1753000129, "type": "reply", "message_id": "182714357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[桃乐丝]演奏出: 1D20+4={15}+4=19"}
{"time": 1753000218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "596756874", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那你注意到许多人都穿着相同的东西—有纽扣的白色制服，和那个疯子医生的衣服如出一辙"}
{"time": 1753000332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "588226625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...这到底是哪？我为什么会在这里。\"在这里翻找"}
{"time": 1753000484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2057715606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd+7"}
{"time": 1753000484, "type": "reply", "message_id": "2057715606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[桃乐丝]演奏出: 1D20+7={17}+7=24"}
{"time": 1753000511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "154042902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那一般直接接触这种堆放比较久的尸体的话，容易染病"}
{"time": 1753000547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "575768647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“枷薇，用法师之手看看这些尸体里有没有藏什么东西吧。”"}
{"time": 1753000570, "type": "recv", "message_id": "194683507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好的，奥契丝姐姐”"}
{"time": 1753000602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2030006186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "伽薇用法师之手翻找了10分钟，大概找到了价值150g的物品"}
{"time": 1753000667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1106671920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "台阶看上去是离开地下室的出口，但是上面倒下的墙壁堵住了路"}
{"time": 1753000765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "857315877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "一个寒冷的铁炉在地下室的角落里放着，四平方英尺的大门半躺开着。附近堆放着沾有血迹的衣服和一些可疑的可燃垃圾。"}
{"time": 1753000822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1723318702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "打开铁炉，"}
{"time": 1753000828, "type": "recv", "message_id": "315127786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看一看里面有什么"}
{"time": 1753000848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "636037552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd+4"}
{"time": 1753000848, "type": "reply", "message_id": "636037552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[桃乐丝]演奏出: 1D20+4={8}+4=12"}
{"time": 1753000851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "470029217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd+3"}
{"time": 1753000851, "type": "reply", "message_id": "470029217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[桃乐丝]演奏出: 1D20+3={15}+3=18"}
{"time": 1753000871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1390777691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "铁炉里面灰烬里的一些被烧焦的人骨，并轻易的分辨出它们分别来自6个人，你注意到炉子的通风口很宽，足以让一个小体型生物轻易地钻进去"}
{"time": 1753000891, "type": "recv", "message_id": "835546835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "让狗钻进去"}
{"time": 1753000905, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1144737146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "同时你发现衣服和垃圾堆中埋着一把精制小提琴。虽然琴弓不见了，但是乐器本身还是完好无损"}
{"time": 1753000935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2138251969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "拿起小提琴，\"这是?某位诗人留在这里的东西吗\""}
{"time": 1753000942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "75368728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd20"}
{"time": 1753000942, "type": "reply", "message_id": "75368728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[桃乐丝]演奏出: 1D20=14"}
{"time": 1753000964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "820496516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "你在小提琴上发现一张羊皮纸。纸上写着“Auseil”"}
{"time": 1753001047, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1335823082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"....\"有些摸不着头脑，看看狗带着什么东西回来了"}
{"time": 1753001182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "390471099", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "狗告诉你管道通往另一个地方，虽然管道比较窄，但你和奥契丝挤挤还是可以进去的"}
{"time": 1753001183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1380187440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这里面似乎有个管道，我们试一试从这里走?\""}
{"time": 1753001203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1090917447", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "狗告诉你管道通往另一个地方，虽然管道比较窄，但你和伽薇挤挤还是可以进去的"}
{"time": 1753001212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "770507189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，伽薇都听奥契丝姐姐的”"}
{"time": 1753001235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "17439646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "尽管管道有不少延伸出去的小管道，但管道可以通过的部分只能通往一个地方"}
{"time": 1753001425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1201020532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "巨大的铁炉被放在这里，它的管道穿入墙壁与天花板。在冰冷的水箱之间的狭窄空隙间布满了阴影与铁锈。"}
