{"time": 1753030871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1148247424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...似乎不能再继续探索了，枷薇。”审视着眼前的事情，“我们得找个地方..休息一下”"}
{"time": 1753030893, "type": "recv", "message_id": "662744525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，奥契丝姐姐，真红好像也快撑不住了...”"}
{"time": 1753030915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "200218710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我在想你直接过五轮体质豁免的事情）"}
